  "duration_s": 566.057007,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "朱军，你知道五十块的瓷器和五十万的瓷器差别在哪里吗？你知道一个小镇凭什么能够代表中国吗？今天挑战一口气，给你讲清楚世界瓷都。景德镇就在今天七月二十五号，景德镇手工瓷业遗存正式列入世界遗产名录。更有意思的是，这次审议地点是在韩国釜山。这些年总有韩国人说，端午是他们的，中餐是他们的，汉服是他们的。但是瓷器他们抢夺不敢抢。如今全国只有一个剩遗名额，凭什么给了景德镇这件事？分量重到难以想象，藏了三个破天荒的第一次。这是第一次中国以产业遗产的名义申报世界遗产，第一次完整申报一座依旧在运转生生不息的手工业城市第一次填补全球世界遗产。名录里，陶瓷文明主题的空白过往，我们申报的大多是宫殿、山川、古村落这类静态古迹，但是景德镇截然不同，它是一个活着的千年年。瓷都千百年窑火生生不息，匠人代代延续。手艺致辞，烟火延续至今。一千年前，景德镇最早叫昌南镇，据说昌南后来演化为china,成为中国的代名词。昌南曾经属于浮梁。白居易说，商人重力轻别离，前月浮梁买茶去奶茶，喝茶就催生了瓷器产业。宋真宗更是把自己的年号景德，赐给这座小镇。从此以后，窑火没灭过，手艺没断过审美，更没倒退过。走在景德镇街上，路灯斑马线，连电线杆都是陶瓷做的。景德镇陶瓷大学把瓷盆当做录取通知书，这需要复印件可以怎么办？景德镇凭什么能烧出全世界最好的瓷器？没有金刚钻，别来瓷器货。景德镇的瓷器白如玉，明如镜，薄如纸，生如镜，你敢信吗？故宫博物院有三十六万件瓷器，竟然有三十三万件来自景德镇。你看这是景德镇的无语菩萨，他确实挺无语的，毕竟他不是菩萨，而是沉思。罗汉菩萨的状态领先。我们几千年呢，没有人能够空手离开景德镇。景德镇最会拿捏现代人的地方，是他把逛街变成了考古。你买的不是流水线上复制出来的标准答案，而是某个年轻人捏歪了一点的杯口，是某次窑火，偶然留下了一片留釉，是画室那天心情很好，才多添的一只小鸟。朱今，你知道景德镇的风水有多好吗？瓷器的核心材料叫高岭土，来自于景德镇浮梁县的高岭村。景德镇周围有山，山里，有瓷石和烧窑所需要的木材、山谷和河流，提供陶洗、陶土驱动、水源和运输原料的条件。昌江水系又把成品送向鄱阳湖长江，再送往中国各地和海外。你看这座城的地理，简直像位烧瓷定制的一张配方表山，负责给材料水，负责给动力和运输火，负责完成质变人负责把这一切组织成产业、天时地利人和，共同促成一条完整的古代瓷器超级产业链。如果以氧化硅为颜料，在速配上，绘画图案被透明，釉罩在下面晶莹剔透，这就是釉下彩青花瓷。明朝郑和下西洋带回来一种颜料，烧出带有黑色斑点的青花瓷，这种颜料叫酥麻沥青。如果颜料含有铜，那就能烧出来红色的釉里红。如果用青料和红料一起烧制，就是青花釉里红。如果以白瓷胎为画布，在釉外面用玻璃白作画，低温二次烧制，这就是釉上彩粉彩瓷。如果用红黄金蓝绿诸多矿物颜料平涂在釉上，这就是光滑的五彩瓷。如果你买到了进口的颜料珐琅，这就是表面有凹凸感的珐琅彩。您家装猪油用的搪瓷缸就是发廊，从珐琅彩发展到粉彩，景德镇的手艺人则叫做爬花内务府，把这种瓷器工艺称之为锦上添花。这些纹样不是画在瓷器上的，也不是贴上去的，而是直接拿一根针头在磁器上刮线。如果不小心刮错一笔，就要全部作废。如果在右上和右下都作画，就是斗彩瓷和青花五彩瓷，这是明朝斗彩鸡缸杯拍出了二点八个亿。当时刷新瓷器全球拍卖纪录。这是什么词？这是龙泉青瓷冰裂纹，每一声脆响，都可能让他身价多一个零，变成十万百万千万甚至一个小目标。它的花纹遇水则化，水干则裂，这就是独属于中国人的冰与火之歌。这是什么词？这是老太太碰死不？这是剑盏开窑，这是什么瓷？这是玲珑瓷，浑身是孔，却滴水不漏，花纹处还会透光鹤光同尘十窑九不成，能否烧成全看运气。这是什么词就是德化白子，远看是杀，近看是词。采用高刃薄胎瓷衣，这何止是瓷器，简直是把灵魂都塑造出来了。这是什么词？这是琉璃荷花盏，当年卷帘大将就是不小心打碎了这玩意儿，被贬下凡，成了沙僧。但我一直怀疑为了一个琉璃盏，至于这样恨他吗？肯定是他做卷帘大将卷帘子的时候，看到什么不该看的。这是什么词？耀变天幕盏，宋代第一茶器，全世界仅存三只完整。这是什么词？这是古瓷洁白如玉。这是什么词？这是景德镇一手作坊匠人做出的像西藏转经筒一样的陶瓷，转起来时，像穿着流苏裙的仙子，这位匠人眼里没有对金钱的渴望，全是对自己手艺的欣赏。这是什么瓷？这是瓷板画快要失传的非遗。这是手艺人在瓷器上手写字，第一次对蝇头小楷有了画面感。景德镇写字匠五千字的金刚经抄在一个杯子上，这是我见过最稳的手。每个字不到一毫米，这睛就是一齿手，就是打印机。烧制瓷器的厂叫窑。宋代形成的瓷窑体系有，六种，北方地区、定窑君窑、词、州窑、耀州窑、南方地区龙泉窑、景德镇的青白瓷窑，后来形成了五大民谣。汝官割君定雨过天青，汝窑子口铁足官窑、金丝铁、剑歌窑、窑变、万彩、均窑、白釉、荷花、定窑、每一件浴火重生的瓷器，都像极了中国人的气质。你知道景德镇为什么这么火吗？得从一只鸭子说起，重申我在景德镇当网红鸭。景德镇御窑厂是明清两朝的皇家瓷厂，每年烧出来的瓷器要精挑细选，不合格，就直接砸碎深埋在地下。几百年下来，御窑厂遗址底下埋着两千多万片碎石。这些碎瓷片里有一只小鸭子，竟然被考古学家一片一片拼回来，成了镇馆之宝碎碎压。为什么现在景漂越来越多了？过去十年新增了十三点六万常住人口。陶西川创意市集从五十五个摊位涨到一千两百多个。摊主平均二十八岁，小县城安置不了肉体北上广，安置不了灵魂来。景德镇捏泥儿身心同时落地如晶。你是不是觉得景德镇的瓷器只能用在厨房和餐厅，那就格局小了。你手机里有一种零件叫多层片式陶瓷电容器，每部手机几百颗每辆新能源汽车几千颗，以前只能靠进口，被人卡着脖子。而现在景德镇自己的企业做出来了，你每天在家里面开灯，关灯电流都会路过景德镇生产的真空开关管磁壳。你坐高铁高铁的轴承里，有一种氮化硅陶瓷轴承，也是景德镇生产的。嫦娥三号登陆月球神舟飞船上天、北斗导航组网、天问一号去火星。这些大国重戏里都有景德镇的特种陶瓷，究竟其实不是景德镇需要世界的认可，是世界需要中国瓷器。中国瓷器一直是世界顶流顶级奢侈品。公元一七一七年，神圣罗马帝国奥古斯特二世招来了一整支六百人的龙骑兵团，使欧洲王侯开疆拓土的精锐。然而，这一次，他们的任务却并非奔赴战场。奥古斯特二世大手一挥，直接将他们全部送给了普鲁士国王，只为换取一百五十一件中国瓷器。意大利有一幅名画叫诸神之焰，画的是希腊众神开派对，手里端的也是中国瓷器。英国人为了仿制中国瓷器配方是几百年，愣是没试出来，法国人更狠，直接派传教士当间谍，潜入景德镇，偷学自食技术，拖了半个多世纪才勉强烧出几件像样的。不是我们输出了技术，而是我们输出了审美。今天，当景德镇手工瓷业遗存成为中国第六十一项世界遗产，世界认可的不只是几处遥指和矿山世界认可的是这样一种能力。把山里的石头变成泥，把泥变成气，把气变成商品，把商品变成审美，把审美变成跨越语言的文明交流。所以下次你端起一只景德镇的杯子，您端起的是一座城。一千年的协作，是无数无名工匠手，是山河泥火与人的共同作品。你端起的也是中国送给世界的一张名片，天青色等烟雨，而我在等你。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00001",
      "start_ms": 390,
      "end_ms": 790,
      "text": "朱军，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1210,
      "end_ms": 5270,
      "text": "你知道五十块的瓷器和五十万的瓷器差别在哪里吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00003",
      "start_ms": 5670,
      "end_ms": 8550,
      "text": "你知道一个小镇凭什么能够代表中国吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00004",
      "start_ms": 8850,
      "end_ms": 9870,
      "text": "今天挑战一口气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00005",
      "start_ms": 9870,
      "end_ms": 11670,
      "text": "给你讲清楚世界瓷都。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00006",
      "start_ms": 11910,
      "end_ms": 15090,
      "text": "景德镇就在今天七月二十五号，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00007",
      "start_ms": 15230,
      "end_ms": 19090,
      "text": "景德镇手工瓷业遗存正式列入世界遗产名录。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00008",
      "start_ms": 19610,
      "end_ms": 20470,
      "text": "更有意思的是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00009",
      "start_ms": 20470,
      "end_ms": 22970,
      "text": "这次审议地点是在韩国釜山。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00010",
      "start_ms": 23550,
      "end_ms": 24950,
      "text": "这些年总有韩国人说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00011",
      "start_ms": 25130,
      "end_ms": 26210,
      "text": "端午是他们的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00012",
      "start_ms": 26230,
      "end_ms": 27270,
      "text": "中餐是他们的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00013",
      "start_ms": 27270,
      "end_ms": 28370,
      "text": "汉服是他们的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00014",
      "start_ms": 28410,
      "end_ms": 30680,
      "text": "但是瓷器他们抢夺不敢抢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00015",
      "start_ms": 30920,
      "end_ms": 33420,
      "text": "如今全国只有一个剩遗名额，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00016",
      "start_ms": 33440,
      "end_ms": 35540,
      "text": "凭什么给了景德镇这件事？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00017",
      "start_ms": 35540,
      "end_ms": 37020,
      "text": "分量重到难以想象，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00018",
      "start_ms": 37140,
      "end_ms": 39100,
      "text": "藏了三个破天荒的第一次。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00019",
      "start_ms": 39400,
      "end_ms": 42760,
      "text": "这是第一次中国以产业遗产的名义申报世界遗产，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00020",
      "start_ms": 43000,
      "end_ms": 49820,
      "text": "第一次完整申报一座依旧在运转生生不息的手工业城市第一次填补全球世界遗产。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00021",
      "start_ms": 49820,
      "end_ms": 50280,
      "text": "名录里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00022",
      "start_ms": 50280,
      "end_ms": 52780,
      "text": "陶瓷文明主题的空白过往，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00023",
      "start_ms": 52780,
      "end_ms": 56700,
      "text": "我们申报的大多是宫殿、山川、古村落这类静态古迹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00024",
      "start_ms": 57000,
      "end_ms": 58500,
      "text": "但是景德镇截然不同，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00025",
      "start_ms": 58740,
      "end_ms": 60290,
      "text": "它是一个活着的千年年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00026",
      "start_ms": 60290,
      "end_ms": 63095,
      "text": "瓷都千百年窑火生生不息，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00027",
      "start_ms": 63360,
      "end_ms": 64600,
      "text": "匠人代代延续。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00028",
      "start_ms": 64620,
      "end_ms": 65445,
      "text": "手艺致辞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00029",
      "start_ms": 65730,
      "end_ms": 67025,
      "text": "烟火延续至今。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00030",
      "start_ms": 67420,
      "end_ms": 68100,
      "text": "一千年前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00031",
      "start_ms": 68180,
      "end_ms": 70100,
      "text": "景德镇最早叫昌南镇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00032",
      "start_ms": 70180,
      "end_ms": 72595,
      "text": "据说昌南后来演化为china,"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00033",
      "start_ms": 72840,
      "end_ms": 74105,
      "text": "成为中国的代名词。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00034",
      "start_ms": 74450,
      "end_ms": 76285,
      "text": "昌南曾经属于浮梁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00035",
      "start_ms": 76570,
      "end_ms": 77210,
      "text": "白居易说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00036",
      "start_ms": 77250,
      "end_ms": 78790,
      "text": "商人重力轻别离，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00037",
      "start_ms": 78810,
      "end_ms": 81340,
      "text": "前月浮梁买茶去奶茶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00038",
      "start_ms": 81520,
      "end_ms": 83455,
      "text": "喝茶就催生了瓷器产业。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00039",
      "start_ms": 83790,
      "end_ms": 86330,
      "text": "宋真宗更是把自己的年号景德，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00040",
      "start_ms": 86370,
      "end_ms": 87325,
      "text": "赐给这座小镇。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00041",
      "start_ms": 87640,
      "end_ms": 88280,
      "text": "从此以后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00042",
      "start_ms": 88400,
      "end_ms": 89500,
      "text": "窑火没灭过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00043",
      "start_ms": 89540,
      "end_ms": 91160,
      "text": "手艺没断过审美，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00044",
      "start_ms": 91160,
      "end_ms": 92095,
      "text": "更没倒退过。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00045",
      "start_ms": 92480,
      "end_ms": 93695,
      "text": "走在景德镇街上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00046",
      "start_ms": 93980,
      "end_ms": 95100,
      "text": "路灯斑马线，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00047",
      "start_ms": 95300,
      "end_ms": 97425,
      "text": "连电线杆都是陶瓷做的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00048",
      "start_ms": 97660,
      "end_ms": 100975,
      "text": "景德镇陶瓷大学把瓷盆当做录取通知书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00049",
      "start_ms": 101250,
      "end_ms": 102685,
      "text": "这需要复印件可以怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00050",
      "start_ms": 102960,
      "end_ms": 105695,
      "text": "景德镇凭什么能烧出全世界最好的瓷器？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00051",
      "start_ms": 106070,
      "end_ms": 106970,
      "text": "没有金刚钻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00052",
      "start_ms": 107050,
      "end_ms": 108155,
      "text": "别来瓷器货。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00053",
      "start_ms": 108520,
      "end_ms": 110340,
      "text": "景德镇的瓷器白如玉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00054",
      "start_ms": 110500,
      "end_ms": 111220,
      "text": "明如镜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00055",
      "start_ms": 111340,
      "end_ms": 112040,
      "text": "薄如纸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00056",
      "start_ms": 112260,
      "end_ms": 113175,
      "text": "生如镜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00057",
      "start_ms": 113680,
      "end_ms": 114280,
      "text": "你敢信吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00058",
      "start_ms": 114280,
      "end_ms": 116205,
      "text": "故宫博物院有三十六万件瓷器，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00059",
      "start_ms": 116500,
      "end_ms": 119085,
      "text": "竟然有三十三万件来自景德镇。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00060",
      "start_ms": 119360,
      "end_ms": 121455,
      "text": "你看这是景德镇的无语菩萨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00061",
      "start_ms": 121700,
      "end_ms": 122780,
      "text": "他确实挺无语的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00062",
      "start_ms": 122780,
      "end_ms": 123920,
      "text": "毕竟他不是菩萨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00063",
      "start_ms": 123920,
      "end_ms": 124840,
      "text": "而是沉思。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00064",
      "start_ms": 124840,
      "end_ms": 126730,
      "text": "罗汉菩萨的状态领先。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00065",
      "start_ms": 126730,
      "end_ms": 127885,
      "text": "我们几千年呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00066",
      "start_ms": 128370,
      "end_ms": 130405,
      "text": "没有人能够空手离开景德镇。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00067",
      "start_ms": 130760,
      "end_ms": 132600,
      "text": "景德镇最会拿捏现代人的地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00068",
      "start_ms": 132600,
      "end_ms": 134555,
      "text": "是他把逛街变成了考古。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00069",
      "start_ms": 134930,
      "end_ms": 137750,
      "text": "你买的不是流水线上复制出来的标准答案，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00070",
      "start_ms": 137830,
      "end_ms": 140690,
      "text": "而是某个年轻人捏歪了一点的杯口，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00071",
      "start_ms": 140870,
      "end_ms": 141870,
      "text": "是某次窑火，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00072",
      "start_ms": 141930,
      "end_ms": 143430,
      "text": "偶然留下了一片留釉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00073",
      "start_ms": 143690,
      "end_ms": 145390,
      "text": "是画室那天心情很好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00074",
      "start_ms": 145510,
      "end_ms": 146945,
      "text": "才多添的一只小鸟。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00075",
      "start_ms": 147290,
      "end_ms": 147705,
      "text": "朱今，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00076",
      "start_ms": 147990,
      "end_ms": 150125,
      "text": "你知道景德镇的风水有多好吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00077",
      "start_ms": 150460,
      "end_ms": 152565,
      "text": "瓷器的核心材料叫高岭土，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00078",
      "start_ms": 152820,
      "end_ms": 155285,
      "text": "来自于景德镇浮梁县的高岭村。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00079",
      "start_ms": 155810,
      "end_ms": 157170,
      "text": "景德镇周围有山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00080",
      "start_ms": 157310,
      "end_ms": 157650,
      "text": "山里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00081",
      "start_ms": 157650,
      "end_ms": 161450,
      "text": "有瓷石和烧窑所需要的木材、山谷和河流，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00082",
      "start_ms": 161650,
      "end_ms": 165615,
      "text": "提供陶洗、陶土驱动、水源和运输原料的条件。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00083",
      "start_ms": 166090,
      "end_ms": 169285,
      "text": "昌江水系又把成品送向鄱阳湖长江，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00084",
      "start_ms": 169530,
      "end_ms": 171155,
      "text": "再送往中国各地和海外。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00085",
      "start_ms": 171590,
      "end_ms": 172930,
      "text": "你看这座城的地理，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00086",
      "start_ms": 173030,
      "end_ms": 176040,
      "text": "简直像位烧瓷定制的一张配方表山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00087",
      "start_ms": 176160,
      "end_ms": 177500,
      "text": "负责给材料水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00088",
      "start_ms": 177640,
      "end_ms": 179470,
      "text": "负责给动力和运输火，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00089",
      "start_ms": 179530,
      "end_ms": 185460,
      "text": "负责完成质变人负责把这一切组织成产业、天时地利人和，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00090",
      "start_ms": 185600,
      "end_ms": 188695,
      "text": "共同促成一条完整的古代瓷器超级产业链。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00091",
      "start_ms": 189150,
      "end_ms": 190650,
      "text": "如果以氧化硅为颜料，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00092",
      "start_ms": 190670,
      "end_ms": 191450,
      "text": "在速配上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00093",
      "start_ms": 191450,
      "end_ms": 192850,
      "text": "绘画图案被透明，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00094",
      "start_ms": 192850,
      "end_ms": 194415,
      "text": "釉罩在下面晶莹剔透，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00095",
      "start_ms": 194640,
      "end_ms": 196685,
      "text": "这就是釉下彩青花瓷。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00096",
      "start_ms": 197000,
      "end_ms": 199265,
      "text": "明朝郑和下西洋带回来一种颜料，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00097",
      "start_ms": 199500,
      "end_ms": 201635,
      "text": "烧出带有黑色斑点的青花瓷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00098",
      "start_ms": 201900,
      "end_ms": 203605,
      "text": "这种颜料叫酥麻沥青。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00099",
      "start_ms": 203920,
      "end_ms": 205020,
      "text": "如果颜料含有铜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00100",
      "start_ms": 205260,
      "end_ms": 207105,
      "text": "那就能烧出来红色的釉里红。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00101",
      "start_ms": 207530,
      "end_ms": 209665,
      "text": "如果用青料和红料一起烧制，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00102",
      "start_ms": 209830,
      "end_ms": 211235,
      "text": "就是青花釉里红。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00103",
      "start_ms": 211670,
      "end_ms": 213370,
      "text": "如果以白瓷胎为画布，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00104",
      "start_ms": 213490,
      "end_ms": 215610,
      "text": "在釉外面用玻璃白作画，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00105",
      "start_ms": 215730,
      "end_ms": 216930,
      "text": "低温二次烧制，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00106",
      "start_ms": 217010,
      "end_ms": 219065,
      "text": "这就是釉上彩粉彩瓷。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00107",
      "start_ms": 219460,
      "end_ms": 223695,
      "text": "如果用红黄金蓝绿诸多矿物颜料平涂在釉上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00108",
      "start_ms": 223920,
      "end_ms": 225445,
      "text": "这就是光滑的五彩瓷。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00109",
      "start_ms": 225790,
      "end_ms": 227950,
      "text": "如果你买到了进口的颜料珐琅，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00110",
      "start_ms": 228150,
      "end_ms": 230330,
      "text": "这就是表面有凹凸感的珐琅彩。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00111",
      "start_ms": 230590,
      "end_ms": 233185,
      "text": "您家装猪油用的搪瓷缸就是发廊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00112",
      "start_ms": 233720,
      "end_ms": 235460,
      "text": "从珐琅彩发展到粉彩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00113",
      "start_ms": 235580,
      "end_ms": 238640,
      "text": "景德镇的手艺人则叫做爬花内务府，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00114",
      "start_ms": 238660,
      "end_ms": 241065,
      "text": "把这种瓷器工艺称之为锦上添花。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00115",
      "start_ms": 241520,
      "end_ms": 243460,
      "text": "这些纹样不是画在瓷器上的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00116",
      "start_ms": 243460,
      "end_ms": 244545,
      "text": "也不是贴上去的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00117",
      "start_ms": 244710,
      "end_ms": 247625,
      "text": "而是直接拿一根针头在磁器上刮线。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00118",
      "start_ms": 248040,
      "end_ms": 249360,
      "text": "如果不小心刮错一笔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00119",
      "start_ms": 249360,
      "end_ms": 250505,
      "text": "就要全部作废。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00120",
      "start_ms": 251000,
      "end_ms": 253320,
      "text": "如果在右上和右下都作画，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00121",
      "start_ms": 253320,
      "end_ms": 255705,
      "text": "就是斗彩瓷和青花五彩瓷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00122",
      "start_ms": 256070,
      "end_ms": 259105,
      "text": "这是明朝斗彩鸡缸杯拍出了二点八个亿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00123",
      "start_ms": 259350,
      "end_ms": 261355,
      "text": "当时刷新瓷器全球拍卖纪录。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00124",
      "start_ms": 261680,
      "end_ms": 262445,
      "text": "这是什么词？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00125",
      "start_ms": 262730,
      "end_ms": 264585,
      "text": "这是龙泉青瓷冰裂纹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00126",
      "start_ms": 264860,
      "end_ms": 265780,
      "text": "每一声脆响，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00127",
      "start_ms": 265780,
      "end_ms": 267565,
      "text": "都可能让他身价多一个零，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00128",
      "start_ms": 267780,
      "end_ms": 270975,
      "text": "变成十万百万千万甚至一个小目标。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00129",
      "start_ms": 271410,
      "end_ms": 272970,
      "text": "它的花纹遇水则化，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00130",
      "start_ms": 273170,
      "end_ms": 274145,
      "text": "水干则裂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00131",
      "start_ms": 274390,
      "end_ms": 276825,
      "text": "这就是独属于中国人的冰与火之歌。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00132",
      "start_ms": 277210,
      "end_ms": 277995,
      "text": "这是什么词？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00133",
      "start_ms": 278330,
      "end_ms": 279970,
      "text": "这是老太太碰死不？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00134",
      "start_ms": 280090,
      "end_ms": 281565,
      "text": "这是剑盏开窑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00135",
      "start_ms": 282080,
      "end_ms": 282860,
      "text": "这是什么瓷？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00136",
      "start_ms": 282940,
      "end_ms": 284160,
      "text": "这是玲珑瓷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00137",
      "start_ms": 284360,
      "end_ms": 285280,
      "text": "浑身是孔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00138",
      "start_ms": 285300,
      "end_ms": 286425,
      "text": "却滴水不漏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00139",
      "start_ms": 286700,
      "end_ms": 290850,
      "text": "花纹处还会透光鹤光同尘十窑九不成，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00140",
      "start_ms": 290950,
      "end_ms": 292485,
      "text": "能否烧成全看运气。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00141",
      "start_ms": 292900,
      "end_ms": 295085,
      "text": "这是什么词就是德化白子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00142",
      "start_ms": 295390,
      "end_ms": 296250,
      "text": "远看是杀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00143",
      "start_ms": 296290,
      "end_ms": 297105,
      "text": "近看是词。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00144",
      "start_ms": 297450,
      "end_ms": 299190,
      "text": "采用高刃薄胎瓷衣，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00145",
      "start_ms": 299250,
      "end_ms": 300390,
      "text": "这何止是瓷器，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00146",
      "start_ms": 300650,
      "end_ms": 302610,
      "text": "简直是把灵魂都塑造出来了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00147",
      "start_ms": 302830,
      "end_ms": 303630,
      "text": "这是什么词？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00148",
      "start_ms": 303770,
      "end_ms": 305470,
      "text": "这是琉璃荷花盏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00149",
      "start_ms": 305770,
      "end_ms": 308830,
      "text": "当年卷帘大将就是不小心打碎了这玩意儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00150",
      "start_ms": 308830,
      "end_ms": 309550,
      "text": "被贬下凡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00151",
      "start_ms": 309550,
      "end_ms": 310210,
      "text": "成了沙僧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00152",
      "start_ms": 310650,
      "end_ms": 312730,
      "text": "但我一直怀疑为了一个琉璃盏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00153",
      "start_ms": 312730,
      "end_ms": 313730,
      "text": "至于这样恨他吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00154",
      "start_ms": 313950,
      "end_ms": 316610,
      "text": "肯定是他做卷帘大将卷帘子的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00155",
      "start_ms": 316630,
      "end_ms": 317810,
      "text": "看到什么不该看的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00156",
      "start_ms": 318030,
      "end_ms": 318830,
      "text": "这是什么词？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00157",
      "start_ms": 319050,
      "end_ms": 320310,
      "text": "耀变天幕盏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00158",
      "start_ms": 320430,
      "end_ms": 321570,
      "text": "宋代第一茶器，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00159",
      "start_ms": 321710,
      "end_ms": 323550,
      "text": "全世界仅存三只完整。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00160",
      "start_ms": 323850,
      "end_ms": 324650,
      "text": "这是什么词？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00161",
      "start_ms": 324750,
      "end_ms": 326995,
      "text": "这是古瓷洁白如玉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00162",
      "start_ms": 327420,
      "end_ms": 328160,
      "text": "这是什么词？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00163",
      "start_ms": 328340,
      "end_ms": 332920,
      "text": "这是景德镇一手作坊匠人做出的像西藏转经筒一样的陶瓷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00164",
      "start_ms": 333100,
      "end_ms": 333820,
      "text": "转起来时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00165",
      "start_ms": 333940,
      "end_ms": 335740,
      "text": "像穿着流苏裙的仙子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00166",
      "start_ms": 336000,
      "end_ms": 338180,
      "text": "这位匠人眼里没有对金钱的渴望，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00167",
      "start_ms": 338200,
      "end_ms": 339920,
      "text": "全是对自己手艺的欣赏。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00168",
      "start_ms": 340400,
      "end_ms": 341260,
      "text": "这是什么瓷？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00169",
      "start_ms": 341400,
      "end_ms": 343980,
      "text": "这是瓷板画快要失传的非遗。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00170",
      "start_ms": 344240,
      "end_ms": 346440,
      "text": "这是手艺人在瓷器上手写字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00171",
      "start_ms": 346620,
      "end_ms": 348780,
      "text": "第一次对蝇头小楷有了画面感。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00172",
      "start_ms": 349160,
      "end_ms": 353020,
      "text": "景德镇写字匠五千字的金刚经抄在一个杯子上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00173",
      "start_ms": 353200,
      "end_ms": 354580,
      "text": "这是我见过最稳的手。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00174",
      "start_ms": 354940,
      "end_ms": 356320,
      "text": "每个字不到一毫米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00175",
      "start_ms": 356460,
      "end_ms": 358090,
      "text": "这睛就是一齿手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00176",
      "start_ms": 358090,
      "end_ms": 359025,
      "text": "就是打印机。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00177",
      "start_ms": 359410,
      "end_ms": 360970,
      "text": "烧制瓷器的厂叫窑。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00178",
      "start_ms": 361350,
      "end_ms": 363110,
      "text": "宋代形成的瓷窑体系有，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00179",
      "start_ms": 363110,
      "end_ms": 363535,
      "text": "六种，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00180",
      "start_ms": 363750,
      "end_ms": 370445,
      "text": "北方地区、定窑君窑、词、州窑、耀州窑、南方地区龙泉窑、景德镇的青白瓷窑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00181",
      "start_ms": 370740,
      "end_ms": 372605,
      "text": "后来形成了五大民谣。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00182",
      "start_ms": 372960,
      "end_ms": 377040,
      "text": "汝官割君定雨过天青，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00183",
      "start_ms": 377220,
      "end_ms": 386850,
      "text": "汝窑子口铁足官窑、金丝铁、剑歌窑、窑变、万彩、均窑、白釉、荷花、定窑、每一件浴火重生的瓷器，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00184",
      "start_ms": 386910,
      "end_ms": 388695,
      "text": "都像极了中国人的气质。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00185",
      "start_ms": 389210,
      "end_ms": 390990,
      "text": "你知道景德镇为什么这么火吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00186",
      "start_ms": 391010,
      "end_ms": 392495,
      "text": "得从一只鸭子说起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00187",
      "start_ms": 392730,
      "end_ms": 395165,
      "text": "重申我在景德镇当网红鸭。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00188",
      "start_ms": 395830,
      "end_ms": 398665,
      "text": "景德镇御窑厂是明清两朝的皇家瓷厂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00189",
      "start_ms": 398950,
      "end_ms": 401145,
      "text": "每年烧出来的瓷器要精挑细选，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00190",
      "start_ms": 401390,
      "end_ms": 401910,
      "text": "不合格，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00191",
      "start_ms": 401910,
      "end_ms": 404155,
      "text": "就直接砸碎深埋在地下。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00192",
      "start_ms": 404540,
      "end_ms": 405400,
      "text": "几百年下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00193",
      "start_ms": 405520,
      "end_ms": 408485,
      "text": "御窑厂遗址底下埋着两千多万片碎石。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00194",
      "start_ms": 408740,
      "end_ms": 410575,
      "text": "这些碎瓷片里有一只小鸭子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00195",
      "start_ms": 410790,
      "end_ms": 412985,
      "text": "竟然被考古学家一片一片拼回来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00196",
      "start_ms": 413170,
      "end_ms": 415115,
      "text": "成了镇馆之宝碎碎压。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00197",
      "start_ms": 415520,
      "end_ms": 417480,
      "text": "为什么现在景漂越来越多了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00198",
      "start_ms": 417480,
      "end_ms": 420265,
      "text": "过去十年新增了十三点六万常住人口。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00199",
      "start_ms": 420710,
      "end_ms": 425075,
      "text": "陶西川创意市集从五十五个摊位涨到一千两百多个。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00200",
      "start_ms": 425310,
      "end_ms": 426695,
      "text": "摊主平均二十八岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00201",
      "start_ms": 427160,
      "end_ms": 429400,
      "text": "小县城安置不了肉体北上广，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00202",
      "start_ms": 429420,
      "end_ms": 431070,
      "text": "安置不了灵魂来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00203",
      "start_ms": 431070,
      "end_ms": 435065,
      "text": "景德镇捏泥儿身心同时落地如晶。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00204",
      "start_ms": 435350,
      "end_ms": 438535,
      "text": "你是不是觉得景德镇的瓷器只能用在厨房和餐厅，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00205",
      "start_ms": 438910,
      "end_ms": 439875,
      "text": "那就格局小了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00206",
      "start_ms": 440090,
      "end_ms": 443785,
      "text": "你手机里有一种零件叫多层片式陶瓷电容器，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00207",
      "start_ms": 444170,
      "end_ms": 447395,
      "text": "每部手机几百颗每辆新能源汽车几千颗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00208",
      "start_ms": 447750,
      "end_ms": 449030,
      "text": "以前只能靠进口，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00209",
      "start_ms": 449030,
      "end_ms": 450050,
      "text": "被人卡着脖子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00210",
      "start_ms": 450130,
      "end_ms": 452715,
      "text": "而现在景德镇自己的企业做出来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00211",
      "start_ms": 453060,
      "end_ms": 454560,
      "text": "你每天在家里面开灯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00212",
      "start_ms": 454620,
      "end_ms": 459075,
      "text": "关灯电流都会路过景德镇生产的真空开关管磁壳。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00213",
      "start_ms": 459560,
      "end_ms": 461360,
      "text": "你坐高铁高铁的轴承里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00214",
      "start_ms": 461360,
      "end_ms": 463480,
      "text": "有一种氮化硅陶瓷轴承，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00215",
      "start_ms": 463560,
      "end_ms": 464895,
      "text": "也是景德镇生产的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00216",
      "start_ms": 465370,
      "end_ms": 470715,
      "text": "嫦娥三号登陆月球神舟飞船上天、北斗导航组网、天问一号去火星。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00217",
      "start_ms": 471050,
      "end_ms": 474325,
      "text": "这些大国重戏里都有景德镇的特种陶瓷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00218",
      "start_ms": 474800,
      "end_ms": 477730,
      "text": "究竟其实不是景德镇需要世界的认可，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00219",
      "start_ms": 477810,
      "end_ms": 479775,
      "text": "是世界需要中国瓷器。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00220",
      "start_ms": 480140,
      "end_ms": 483265,
      "text": "中国瓷器一直是世界顶流顶级奢侈品。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00221",
      "start_ms": 483780,
      "end_ms": 484920,
      "text": "公元一七一七年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00222",
      "start_ms": 485160,
      "end_ms": 489910,
      "text": "神圣罗马帝国奥古斯特二世招来了一整支六百人的龙骑兵团，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00223",
      "start_ms": 490070,
      "end_ms": 492505,
      "text": "使欧洲王侯开疆拓土的精锐。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00224",
      "start_ms": 492850,
      "end_ms": 493110,
      "text": "然而，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00225",
      "start_ms": 493110,
      "end_ms": 493530,
      "text": "这一次，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00226",
      "start_ms": 493530,
      "end_ms": 495465,
      "text": "他们的任务却并非奔赴战场。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00227",
      "start_ms": 495940,
      "end_ms": 497600,
      "text": "奥古斯特二世大手一挥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00228",
      "start_ms": 497760,
      "end_ms": 499925,
      "text": "直接将他们全部送给了普鲁士国王，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00229",
      "start_ms": 500260,
      "end_ms": 503195,
      "text": "只为换取一百五十一件中国瓷器。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00230",
      "start_ms": 503960,
      "end_ms": 506100,
      "text": "意大利有一幅名画叫诸神之焰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00231",
      "start_ms": 506180,
      "end_ms": 508040,
      "text": "画的是希腊众神开派对，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00232",
      "start_ms": 508160,
      "end_ms": 510155,
      "text": "手里端的也是中国瓷器。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00233",
      "start_ms": 510670,
      "end_ms": 513730,
      "text": "英国人为了仿制中国瓷器配方是几百年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00234",
      "start_ms": 513730,
      "end_ms": 514705,
      "text": "愣是没试出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00235",
      "start_ms": 514950,
      "end_ms": 515735,
      "text": "法国人更狠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00236",
      "start_ms": 516110,
      "end_ms": 517870,
      "text": "直接派传教士当间谍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00237",
      "start_ms": 517890,
      "end_ms": 518870,
      "text": "潜入景德镇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00238",
      "start_ms": 518970,
      "end_ms": 520285,
      "text": "偷学自食技术，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00239",
      "start_ms": 520520,
      "end_ms": 523675,
      "text": "拖了半个多世纪才勉强烧出几件像样的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00240",
      "start_ms": 524140,
      "end_ms": 525460,
      "text": "不是我们输出了技术，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00241",
      "start_ms": 525520,
      "end_ms": 526795,
      "text": "而是我们输出了审美。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00242",
      "start_ms": 527370,
      "end_ms": 527770,
      "text": "今天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00243",
      "start_ms": 527910,
      "end_ms": 531665,
      "text": "当景德镇手工瓷业遗存成为中国第六十一项世界遗产，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00244",
      "start_ms": 532090,
      "end_ms": 537105,
      "text": "世界认可的不只是几处遥指和矿山世界认可的是这样一种能力。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00245",
      "start_ms": 537480,
      "end_ms": 539295,
      "text": "把山里的石头变成泥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00246",
      "start_ms": 539620,
      "end_ms": 540900,
      "text": "把泥变成气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00247",
      "start_ms": 541100,
      "end_ms": 542540,
      "text": "把气变成商品，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00248",
      "start_ms": 542680,
      "end_ms": 544285,
      "text": "把商品变成审美，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00249",
      "start_ms": 544490,
      "end_ms": 547195,
      "text": "把审美变成跨越语言的文明交流。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00250",
      "start_ms": 547700,
      "end_ms": 549735,
      "text": "所以下次你端起一只景德镇的杯子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00251",
      "start_ms": 549970,
      "end_ms": 551350,
      "text": "您端起的是一座城。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00252",
      "start_ms": 551390,
      "end_ms": 552555,
      "text": "一千年的协作，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00253",
      "start_ms": 552840,
      "end_ms": 554845,
      "text": "是无数无名工匠手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00254",
      "start_ms": 555160,
      "end_ms": 558855,
      "text": "是山河泥火与人的共同作品。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00255",
      "start_ms": 559260,
      "end_ms": 562445,
      "text": "你端起的也是中国送给世界的一张名片，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00256",
      "start_ms": 562890,
      "end_ms": 564265,
      "text": "天青色等烟雨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c32c7ef65630bbdb_s00257",
      "start_ms": 564520,
      "end_ms": 565695,
      "text": "而我在等你。"
    }
  ],
